  "The installer creates its own backend resources and registers the Rivetin Island. It does not patch official frontend files or restart official Tower services. It refuses unknown ownership instead of taking over an unmanaged deployment. Installation finishes globally disabled.": "安装器创建自己的后端资源，并注册 Rivetin Island，不修改官方前端文件或重启官方 Tower 服务。归属无法确认时会拒绝接管。安装完成后，框架全局保持禁用。",
  "Explicitly enable the framework": "明确启用框架",
  "Enabling the framework does not enable an individually disabled extension or grant SSH collection rights.": "启用框架不会自动启用单独关闭的扩展，也不会授予 SSH 采集权限。",
  "05 / Manage extensions": "05 / 管理扩展",
  "Install. Configure. Enable.": "安装。配置。启用。",
  "List and install extensions": "列出并安装扩展",
  "Enable an installed extension": "启用已安装的扩展",
  "Save functional changes explicitly. Closing an unsaved editor offers save, discard or cancel; failed saves retain the draft. Uninstall removes the active registration but retains configuration and packages. Package updates must increase the version and preserve the current configuration schema; automatic schema migration is not available.": "功能修改需要明确保存。关闭未保存的编辑器时，可选择保存、丢弃或取消；保存失败会保留草稿。卸载移除活动注册，但保留配置与安装包。包更新必须提升版本，并维持当前配置 schema；尚不支持 schema 自动迁移。",
  "06 / SSH collection": "06 / SSH 采集",
  "A shared channel.": "共享的通道。",
  "An explicit approval.": "明确的授权。",
  "Inspect the SSH channel": "检查 SSH 通道",
  "Connection drafts can be edited in the authenticated SSH settings page or imported from a controlled sensitive file through the CLI. Credentials use an explicit host-over-cluster-over-global priority without mixing fields across levels. The backend encrypts saved secrets; read responses expose presence flags only. Draft changes require an explicit save, revoke approvals, and do not start host connections. This website never collects credentials.": "可在认证后的 SSH 设置页编辑连接草稿，也可通过 CLI 导入受控的敏感文件。整组凭据按主机、集群、全局的优先级选择，不跨层拼接字段。后端加密保存秘密，读取响应只返回存在标记。草稿需要明确保存，保存会撤销审批，且不会启动主机连接。本站不收集凭据。",
  "Import a controlled host profile": "导入受控的主机配置",
  "Importing or removing a profile revokes related approvals and does not start a host connection. Changes to commands, versions, targets, schedules or channel settings require a new review. Arbitrary shell, destructive operations and unknown operation types are rejected.": "导入或移除配置会撤销相关审批，不会建立主机连接。命令、版本、目标、计划或通道设置改变后，都需要重新审阅。任意 shell、破坏性操作和未知操作类型均被拒绝。",
  "SSH Channel 0.1.1 is enabled in the controlled deployment; connection editing, inventory and unsaved-draft exit have read-only browser acceptance. Collection settings, credentials, approvals and schedules remain unconfigured, and no real SSH host has been connected. The bounded recent-result buffer is separate from the framework’s persistent per-disk SMART history. The shared provider and HTTP history consumer have local integration coverage, but real samples, actual history and cross-day collection remain unverified.": "SSH 通道 0.1.1 已在受控部署中启用，连接编辑、库存及未保存草稿退出已通过只读浏览器验收。采集设置、凭据、审批和计划仍未配置，也未连接真实 SSH 主机。有限的近期结果缓存与框架逐盘持久 SMART 历史相互独立。共享提供器与 HTTP 历史消费已有本地集成验证，但真实样本、实际历史和跨日采集仍未验证。",
  "07 / Updates & recovery": "07 / 更新与恢复",
  "Keep a way back.": "留好退路。",
