Object.assign(messages, {
  "Version 0.1.2 completed limited read-only interface checks with Rivetin 0.2.2 while the channel remained off. These checks did not execute SSH connections, host commands, collection, approval, migration or cross-day schedules. The historical v3 package remains 0.1.1 for the 0.1 framework line; current download availability follows the published v4 catalog. With Rivetin 0.2.4, one controlled saved host completed one built-in host.identity review, explicit one-use approval and fixed-command execution, with the original result query matching its persisted receipt. That result does not validate SMART consumer execution, general command registration or all hosts. Migration, valid SMART health samples, cross-day collection and real revocation or I/O fault handling remain unverified.": "0.1.2已在Rivetin 0.2.2组合完成通道保持停用时的受限只读界面检查，该历史检查没有执行SSH连接、主机命令、采集、审批、迁移或跨日计划。历史v3包仍为面向0.1框架的0.1.1，当前下载以已发布v4目录为准。在Rivetin 0.2.4组合中，一台受控已保存主机另完成一次内置host.identity审核、明确的一次性批准和固定命令执行，原结果查询与持久化回执一致。该结果不证明SMART消费执行、通用命令注册或所有主机通过；迁移、有效SMART健康样本、跨日采集及真实撤权或I/O故障处理仍未验证。",
  "This is a standalone local demonstration with synthetic data. Local validation covers keyboard movement of a VDS together with its child networks and updated connections. Draft creation, uplink edits and timed rollback remain simulations, not live network changes. Source publication does not establish a standard plugin release or CloudTower acceptance; real installation remains gated. CloudTower installation work is in progress locally; no real deployment or installed-feature acceptance has been completed.": "这是使用模拟数据的独立本地演示，已验证VDS及其子网络的键盘移动和连线更新。草稿创建、上行链路编辑和限时回滚仍属模拟，不是真实网络变更。源码同步不代表标准插件发布或CloudTower验收。CloudTower实装工作正在本地推进，尚未完成真实部署或已安装功能验收。",
  "The exported JSON is a project-specific review draft, not an Everoute API request or directly importable policy. Inputs stay in memory; only the saved label key uses shared configuration. The extension does not make AI calls, write labels, deploy policies or enable WORK mode. Source updates remain an offline preview, with no published standard plugin package or live CloudTower/Everoute acceptance. Planned CloudTower integration adds Policy Converter to the Everoute left navigation and opens the full tool in the right main content area. That local integration work is not yet deployed or accepted.": "导出的JSON是项目专用审阅草稿，不是Everoute API请求，也不能作为策略直接导入。输入仅保存在内存，只有已保存的标签键使用共享配置。扩展不调用AI、不写标签、不部署策略、不启用WORK模式；当前仍为离线源码预览，未发布标准插件包或通过真实CloudTower/Everoute验收。计划中的接入是在Everoute左侧导航增加安全策略转换入口，并在右侧主内容区展示完整工具；本地接入工作尚未部署或验收。",
  "Framework source 0.2.4": "框架源码0.2.4",
  "SMART collection and history remain available even though the SMART data API is no longer listed in component monitoring. The market monitor checks the current server-side read-only catalog query; a successful service check does not establish a successful download or installation.": "SMART数据API不再列于组件监控，但SMART采集和历史功能仍保留。市场监控核对当前服务端只读清单查询；服务检查成功不能证明下载或安装成功。",
  "Earlier framework source": "先前框架源码",
  "Fixed build deployed; framework source synchronized": "固定构建已部署；框架源码已同步",
  "Starting with Rivetin 0.2.4, framework-version eligibility uses the declared minimum inclusively. A valid legacy maximum field is deprecated metadata: it does not set an upper gate or change the compatibility meaning. The framework API, exact Tower build and SMTX checks still apply independently. Meeting these conditions does not establish that every future build has been tested.": "自Rivetin 0.2.4起，框架版本准入按声明的最低版本判断，包含最低边界。格式有效的旧最高版本字段仅为废弃元数据，不再设置上限门槛或改变兼容性含义。框架API、准确Tower构建和SMTX条件仍须独立满足；符合这些条件不能证明未来每个构建都已实测。",
  "New schema 2 declarations that omit the deprecated maximum field must declare a minimum of 0.2.4 or later. Validators reject lower minimums rather than silently raising them. Older 0.2.2 and 0.2.3 parsers still require the legacy field and can reject an entire V4 catalog if even one entry omits it.": "不含废弃最高版本字段的新schema 2声明，最低版本必须至少为0.2.4。校验器拒绝更低最低版本，不静默替作者提高声明。旧0.2.2和0.2.3解析器仍要求该旧字段，即使只有一条记录省略，也可能拒读整份V4目录。",
  "The existing published catalog and packages keep their original bytes and legacy syntax while serving older readers. The new reader ignores the old upper limit. Omitting the field in a production catalog requires an explicitly agreed reader baseline of 0.2.4. The current packages retain the legacy field for older readers.": "继续服务旧读取版本时，当前已发布目录和安装包保持原字节及旧语法。新读取版本忽略旧上限；生产目录省略该字段须先明确以0.2.4为读取基线。当前安装包保留旧字段以服务旧读取版本。",
  "Two checks apply: the installer matches an exact Tower image and component layout; extension eligibility independently checks the framework API, the declared minimum framework version, exact Tower builds and any SMTX condition. A major release such as “4.9” does not establish compatibility.": "需要同时满足两项检查：安装器匹配准确的Tower镜像和组件布局；扩展准入独立核对框架API、声明的最低框架版本、准确Tower构建及适用的SMTX条件。“4.9”这样的主版本号不能证明兼容。",
  "The package path uses the published v4 IPMI version when available; otherwise it keeps an explicit version placeholder. It is not proof of release or live acceptance. Old v3 declarations do not pass the 0.2 gate. Obtain a verified package and check its minimum framework version before running this example.": "有已发布v4 IPMI版本时，示例包路径使用该版本；否则保留明确的版本占位符。示例不能证明发布或实机验收。旧v3声明无法通过0.2门禁；运行前请取得经过验证的包，并核对其最低框架版本。",
  "Built-in host identity": "内置主机身份诊断",
  "The built-in check is manual and has no editable command arguments or schedule. Its one-use approval expires after two minutes. If the response is lost or the result is unknown, query the original request; do not automatically execute again. A successful identity result reports only the system, release and architecture, without establishing device health or a valid SMART sample.": "内置检查仅手动执行，不接受可编辑命令参数或计划。一次性授权在两分钟后到期。响应丢失或结果未知时，应查询原请求，不自动再次执行。成功身份结果仅报告系统、内核版本和架构，不能据此判定设备健康或已取得有效SMART样本。",
  "Saved legacy connections can be verified without migrating them for an identity check. Connection editing and saving still require explicit Connections v2 migration where applicable. Verification of a saved connection is available outside the disabled legacy editor; it does not discover or silently accept a new host key.": "已保存的旧连接可直接用于验证，无需为身份检查先做迁移。适用时，编辑和保存仍要求显式迁移到Connections v2。验证已保存连接的入口位于旧版禁用编辑区之外，不发现或静默接受新的主机密钥。",
  "On October 29, 2026, the coordinator confirmed a separate single-host built-in identity check with Rivetin 0.2.4 and SSH Channel 0.1.2. One controlled saved host completed one review, one explicit approval and one execution of the fixed host.identity command in the same browser document. The result contained structured Linux kernel and architecture information; querying the original result matched its persisted receipt. This validates only that built-in check, not SMART consumer execution, general command registration or every host. Migration, valid SMART health samples, cross-day collection and real revocation or I/O fault handling remain unverified.": "主协调确认：2026年10月29日，在Rivetin 0.2.4与SSH通道0.1.2组合中，另一项内置单主机身份检查已完成。一台受控已保存主机在同一浏览器文档内完成一次审核、一次明确批准及一次固定host.identity命令执行，返回结构化Linux内核和架构信息；查询原结果与持久化回执一致。该结果仅证明此内置检查，不代表SMART消费执行、通用命令注册或所有主机通过。迁移、有效SMART健康样本、跨日采集及真实撤权或I/O故障处理仍未验证。",
  "The coordinator confirmed a fixed Rivetin 0.2.4 build deployed and enabled in one controlled development/test environment on October 29, 2026. The four existing plugin packages remained enabled with unchanged bytes. Controlled Chinese interface checks at 1280 by 720 showed four compatible installed market entries with minimum versions and no upper-bound display, the verified market service check, the Rivetin Website link and the saved-connection Verify control outside the disabled legacy editor. No authentication or built-in identity command was executed in that interface pass. The observed runtime was 0.2.4; compatibility above the former maximum was tested only in a local simulated context. SSH and resource API monitoring, real SMART health samples and cross-day collection remain unverified. The earlier 0.2.4 source publication remains a separate historical record. Earlier 0.2.2 source and deployment records and the separate 0.2.3 interface checks remain historical; the separate single-host identity result is recorded in the SSH section.": "主协调确认：2026年10月29日，一个固定Rivetin 0.2.4构建已在受控开发测试环境部署启用，原四个插件包保持启用且字节未变。本轮1280×720中文界面看到四个兼容、已安装的市场条目，仅显示最低版本、不显示上限；市场服务检查、Rivetin Website链接，以及禁用旧编辑区之外的已保存连接Verify入口亦已核对。该界面验收没有执行认证或内置身份命令。实际运行版本为0.2.4，高于旧最高版本的兼容性只在本地模拟上下文验证。SSH和资源API监控、有效SMART健康样本及跨日采集仍未验证。此前0.2.4源码发布作为独立历史记录保留。旧0.2.2源码和部署记录及另行完成的0.2.3界面检查保留为历史；单主机身份诊断的独立结果见SSH章节。"
});

