  "Rivetin 0.2.3 adds a built-in single-host identity check, separate from consuming extensions. A Tower {0} user selects one saved host, reviews the fixed {1} command, explicitly acknowledges and approves it once, then separately chooses Execute. Approval alone does not run the command or grant SMART collection rights.": "Rivetin 0.2.3新增独立于消费插件的内置单主机身份检查。Tower {0}用户选择一台已保存主机，审核固定{1}命令，明确勾选确认并批准一次，再单独点击执行。批准本身不执行命令，也不授予SMART采集权限。"
