  "Policy Converter: bounded live check": "安全策略转换：限定实机检查",
  "On October 29, 2026, the fixed Policy Converter 0.1.4 package completed installation, enablement and a bounded Chinese tool-page check with framework 0.2.6 on CloudTower 4.9.0. The native Everoute entry, workpage, cancel/discard with retained input or restored native content, and empty reentry were checked. A sample produced three policies and four rules without blocking diagnostics; the actual 2579-byte rivetin-policy-review-v1 download matched the displayed members and rules, with canDeploy=false and MONITOR policies. The coordinator accepted the separate post-interface protection check. Forty-four shared-module warnings and one initialization HTTP 504 from the host page were recorded; the failing endpoint and root cause remain unconfirmed. Other languages were not switched in the real environment, and no shared configuration, label, policy or WORK action was submitted. This result does not establish market publication or real policy deployment.": "2026年10月29日，固定安全策略转换0.1.4包已在CloudTower 4.9.0与框架0.2.6组合完成安装、启用及限定中文工具页检查。已核对Everoute原生入口、工作页、取消保留输入或丢弃恢复原生内容，以及重入清空。样例生成3策略和4规则、无阻断诊断；实际下载的2579字节rivetin-policy-review-v1与界面成员和规则匹配，canDeploy=false且策略全为MONITOR。主协调另行接受页面操作后的保护检查。记录44条共享模块警告和1条宿主页面初始化HTTP 504，失败端点与根因仍未确认。实机未切其他语言，未提交共享配置、标签、策略或WORK操作。该结果不代表市场发布或真实策略部署。"
